e file content for each file you need created/modified\n2. Install commands\n3. A brief summary: what changed, why, any blockers\n4. The unit test plan for `cn()` helper","run_in_background":false}}],"model":"qwen3.6-35b","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":146149,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8fb51005-a686-498d-8403-19206d765de7","uuid":"c73afca8-2b38-48d3-9698-5d81057a5de7","timestamp":"2026-08-04T06:31:30.561Z"}
